   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 1.2. Increased institutional capacity of workers&apos; organizations</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enterprise level workers representative trained on Occupational Safety and Health standards and protocols (including COVID19 risk prevention and mitigation), enabling trade unions to improve their services to members AND use of digital platform (WhatsApp) for dissemination of communication materials (including short videos) to raise awareness among TU members on OSH and workers&apos; rights. Technical and financial support to design and conduct the TOT. 
Technical support to design communication materials.</narrative>
   </description>
